FIELD RULES

official_brand_name:
Use the supplied official brand name.

target_entity_name:
The entity or franchise system whose active operation countries are being searched.

target_entity_basis:
Briefly explain why this target was selected from brand_owner / parent_company / franchise system.

active_operations_status:
Use one of:
- "verified_active_operations"
- "partial_active_operations"
- "insufficient_active_operations_evidence"
- "conflicting_active_operations_evidence"

active_operation_markets:
Complete list of countries, markets, or separately reported territories where active on-the-ground operations are supported.

total_active_operation_markets:
